**[P1] (confidence: 9/10)** The plan's `testGhosttyCLIRunsActions` (`Process`-run `ghostty +ssh-cache`) writes to the developer's real home. Upstream `src/cli/ssh-cache/DiskCache.zig`:

```zig
/// On all platforms, this is `${XDG_STATE_HOME}/ghostty/ssh_cache`.
pub fn defaultPath(alloc: Allocator, program: []const u8) ![]const u8 {
    const state_dir = xdg.state(global.io(), alloc, &environ_map, .{ .subdir = program });
```

`src/os/xdg.zig:40` defaults that to `~/.local/state`. Prior learning applied: **qa-isolated-home-not-real-config** (10/10) — macapp tests must not mutate real user state.

